  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>(a) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>Be</mi></math></p><p>(b) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></p><p>(c) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math></p><p>(d) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math></p><p>The ionization enthalpy order is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>Be</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Be</mi></math> has more <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>IE</mi></math> compared to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> due to extra stability <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math> has more <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>IE</mi></math>&nbsp;compared to oxygen due to extra stability Hence,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>1402</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>1314</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>801</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Be</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>899</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>",
